# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets & credentials — never commit any of these regardless of where in
# the tree they're dropped. `.env`/`.venv` above already cover the main
# cases; this section is the broader safety net (added 2026-08-22 after
# finding an un-ignored GCP service-account key sitting in the repo root —
# never committed, but shouldn't have been trackable in the first place).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Cloud provider service-account / credential key files (GCP, Firebase, ...)
*service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
*serviceaccount*.json
fresh-fusion-*.json

# OAuth token caches (the standard filenames google-auth-oauthlib's own
# quickstart docs tell you to save these as — credentials.json is the
# downloaded OAuth client secret, token.json/token.pickle is the minted
# user token) — this repo's own OAuth client secret lives in .env instead,
# but guard against anyone following that convention by habit.
credentials.json
token.json
token.pickle

# TLS/SSH private keys and keystores
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.jks
id_rsa
id_rsa.*
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.*
id_ecdsa
id_ecdsa.*

# Generic catch-all for anything explicitly named as a secret/credential
# dropped ad hoc into the tree (e.g. during local debugging).
*secret*.json
*secrets*.json
*.secrets

# Kokoro TTS model files (~340-430 MB) — run backend/scripts/download_kokoro.py
backend/models/kokoro/
